<title>BELGIUM: CNP/NPM TO DELIST IN PARIS.</title>
<headline>CNP/NPM TO DELIST IN PARIS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Nationale Portefeuillemaatschappij/Compagnie Nationale a Portefeuille (CNP/NPM) said on Friday it would delist on the Paris bourse in October.</p>
<p>&quot;(CNP) has requested the removal of its stock from the second market of the Paris Bourse. This removal will take effect in October,&quot; it said in a statement on first-half earnings.</p>
<p>It said it made the decision after noting that the bulk of volume of activity was recorded in Brussels.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
